FIT:

Feature	Typical range
Capacity	40–60 L for multi-day trekking
Back/torso length	~41–53 cm (16–21 in), ideally adjustable
Overall height	~60–75 cm
Width	~28–35 cm
Depth	~20–30 cm
Shoulder straps	Adjustable vertically; ideally with load-lifter straps
Chest/sternum strap	Adjustable in height and width
Hip belt	Adjustable, usually ~70–130 cm depending on model
Compression straps	Usually 2–4, allowing the pack to be tightened when not full
